---
title: Weeknight Chili
description: Beef and bean chili in under an hour.
servings: 4
course: dinner
cuisine: tex-mex
prep time: 10 min
cook time: 45 min
tags: [comfort, batch]
---
Brown @minced beef{500%g} with @onion{1} and @garlic{2%cloves} in a #heavy pot{} for ~{8%minutes}.

Stir in @chili powder{2%tsp} and @cumin{1%tsp}, then @chopped tomatoes{400%g} and @kidney beans{2%cans}.

Simmer for ~{35%minutes}, and serve with @rice{300%g}.
